      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-08-12T17:30:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm then I guess we would at some point have to do an exercise where we find out all the places where we set FLAG_ variables and get rid of them. Maybe we should log a warning in reproxy / Soong when we actually set / use a FLAG_ variable and then convert all of them but that\u0027s outside the scope of this CL so lgtm.",
      "parentUuid": "0e4857d3_3751cbee",
